            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This is a basic overview of liposuction. Liposuction is the removal of fat using cannulas (tubes) inserted through tiny incisions into the adipose tissue. When done correctly, nice results can be safely achieved with a very easy procedure.</AbstractText>
